WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:15.619
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:15.889 --> 01:19.226
[8. We Were Eighteen]

3
01:24.856 --> 01:26.519
[Episode 8]

4
01:33.900 --> 01:35.375
Go on in.

5
01:35.375 --> 01:36.556
Okay.

6
01:37.242 --> 01:38.402
Well...

7
01:47.579 --> 01:49.260
Hey...

8
01:52.906 --> 01:54.569
Shall we shake hands?

9
01:55.166 --> 01:56.326
What?

10
01:56.326 --> 01:57.611
A handshake.

11
01:58.223 --> 02:00.813
Why a handshake?

12
02:04.583 --> 02:06.466
Since we're dating now?

13
02:08.218 --> 02:09.928
Just do it.

14
02:19.036 --> 02:20.814
Nice to meet you.

15
02:23.125 --> 02:25.101
What is this?

16
02:28.954 --> 02:30.596
I'll head in now.

17
02:35.213 --> 02:36.764
Don't see her.

18
02:47.185 --> 02:49.269
I said don't see her.

19
02:49.269 --> 02:50.798
I don't want to.

20
02:52.444 --> 02:54.222
Don't see Hye Min.

21
02:55.556 --> 02:56.993
Look, Noh Si Ha.

22
02:56.993 --> 02:59.201
I clearly rejected you.

23
02:59.201 --> 03:00.784
I don't like you.

24
03:00.784 --> 03:02.361
You're not the one.

25
03:03.288 --> 03:05.707
Then shouldn't I decide what I do next?

26
03:05.707 --> 03:07.501
I hate Hye Min.

27
03:07.501 --> 03:10.911
Even if it's not me, don't see her.

28
03:16.385 --> 03:17.570
No.

29
03:18.804 --> 03:20.295
I'm going to see her.

30
03:35.779 --> 03:38.800
I was going to go say hello. What brings you here?

31
03:38.800 --> 03:41.706
Where have you been?

32
03:42.953 --> 03:45.413
I went to visit my parents.

33
03:45.413 --> 03:47.810
Did something happen?

34
03:47.810 --> 03:50.398
No. It was nothing special.

35
03:51.712 --> 03:58.554
Yu Gyeom's mother, has it been over 20 years since you came to this house?

36
03:58.554 --> 03:59.852
Yes.

37
03:59.852 --> 04:01.168
If that's the case...

38
04:01.974 --> 04:08.308
You shouldn't visit your parents unless someone has died.

39
04:08.308 --> 04:13.650
Even if someone dies, you should think twice about going.

40
04:13.650 --> 04:14.692
Father.

41
04:14.692 --> 04:19.399
That's how you truly become a member of this family.

42
04:22.492 --> 04:24.507
Father. I'm sorry.

43
04:31.593 --> 04:33.974
Mom. You're a maid.

44
04:33.974 --> 04:36.761
You only leave that house when you die.

45
04:40.218 --> 04:42.439
- Mom. - What?

46
04:43.388 --> 04:45.265
Yu Gyeom won't wake up.

47
04:45.265 --> 04:46.319
What?

48
04:48.060 --> 04:49.895
What's wrong with him?

49
04:49.895 --> 04:52.648
Did something happen while I was away?

50
04:52.648 --> 04:54.716
Mom, I wasn't here either.

51
04:56.713 --> 04:58.273
Yu Gyeom.

52
05:00.066 --> 05:01.363
Yu Gyeom?

53
05:04.742 --> 05:07.000
My son.

54
05:07.000 --> 05:09.924
He's burning up with a fever. What should we do?

55
05:10.937 --> 05:12.584
You can't.

56
05:12.584 --> 05:13.793
Let go.

57
05:13.793 --> 05:14.830
Really.

58
05:14.830 --> 05:16.963
Seriously, you...

59
05:16.963 --> 05:19.299
Who are you to stop me from seeing him?

60
05:19.967 --> 05:22.552
What are you doing here so early in the morning?

61
05:22.552 --> 05:26.014
I'm the one your father approved of.

62
05:26.014 --> 05:29.516
Your almighty father.

63
05:31.394 --> 05:33.073
Right.

64
05:33.073 --> 05:38.860
But my almighty father says he doesn't want you to see Yu Gyeom anymore.

65
05:38.860 --> 05:41.042
So just leave.

66
05:41.042 --> 05:42.238
Why?

67
05:42.238 --> 05:44.053
Did your wife ask you that?

68
05:44.053 --> 05:45.742
Did she beg you to keep me away from her son?

69
05:45.742 --> 05:49.663
Please don't bring Ji Yeong into this.

70
05:49.663 --> 05:53.249
It gives me the creeps every time her name comes out of your mouth.

71
05:53.249 --> 05:55.260
Look here, Cho Jae Jin.

72
05:55.260 --> 05:57.358
Get a grip.

73
05:57.358 --> 05:59.836
People would think I'm your mistress.

74
05:59.836 --> 06:03.494
I'm the first wife. She's the second.

75
06:03.494 --> 06:05.261
Don't you know what that means?

76
06:05.261 --> 06:08.056
That's what you and my father decided.

77
06:08.056 --> 06:10.058
I never agreed to any of it.

78
06:10.058 --> 06:11.272
What?

79
06:12.561 --> 06:14.257
It was a one-night mistake.

80
06:14.257 --> 06:15.453
Who?

81
06:15.453 --> 06:16.616
Me?

82
06:17.857 --> 06:20.568
Me? Not Lee Ji Yeong, but me?

83
06:20.568 --> 06:21.868
Yes.

84
06:21.868 --> 06:22.904
You.

85
06:22.904 --> 06:24.988
Stop talking nonsense.

86
06:25.574 --> 06:28.089
I was your first love.

87
06:37.836 --> 06:39.165
Jae Jin.

88
06:39.165 --> 06:41.121
I haven't forgotten a thing.

89
06:41.121 --> 06:43.883
I remember every inch of your body.

90
06:43.883 --> 06:47.179
And you remember every inch of mine, don't you?

91
06:47.179 --> 06:49.502
That was over 20 years ago.

92
06:50.917 --> 06:53.268
You were really something back then.

93
06:53.268 --> 06:55.729
You were so cool at the Olympics.

94
06:55.729 --> 06:59.710
I was so proud that you were my man.

95
07:00.859 --> 07:03.494
But look at you now.

96
07:03.494 --> 07:06.319
How did you become worse than trash?

97
07:06.319 --> 07:08.241
Is this a family trait?

98
07:08.241 --> 07:10.640
Turning a fine person into a total wreck?

99
07:10.640 --> 07:12.829
It must be a family trait.

100
07:12.829 --> 07:15.248
Come to think of it, you're not the only one.

101
07:15.248 --> 07:19.210
Il Hee, Dul Hee, Sam Hee, and now even Yu Gyeom.

102
07:19.210 --> 07:23.631
I will never let Yu Gyeom end up like that.

103
07:23.631 --> 07:27.673
I would hate for Yu Gyeom to become like you.

104
07:30.985 --> 07:33.117
Don't worry.

105
07:33.117 --> 07:34.559
He won't end up like me.

106
07:34.559 --> 07:35.868
No.

107
07:35.868 --> 07:36.895
I think he will.

108
07:36.895 --> 07:38.772
Even so, it's not your business.

109
07:38.772 --> 07:40.951
Why is it none of my business? I'm his--

110
07:40.951 --> 07:42.105
Dad.

111
07:43.697 --> 07:45.470
Dad, hurry up.

112
07:45.470 --> 07:46.798
Hurry up.

113
07:55.789 --> 07:57.981
Your mom left.

114
07:59.792 --> 08:03.505
But why do you have to be so mean?

115
08:03.505 --> 08:05.007
I can't even talk.

116
08:05.007 --> 08:06.841
Jeez.

117
08:06.841 --> 08:09.928
You should cherish those who are precious to you.

118
08:09.928 --> 08:13.400
Whether it's your sister or your mom...

119
08:13.400 --> 08:15.479
You just say whatever...

120
08:18.140 --> 08:20.390
You just lash out at them.

121
08:22.107 --> 08:24.310
Do you have anger management issues?

122
08:28.822 --> 08:30.417
Come out already.

123
08:30.417 --> 08:34.373
It's my first day off in a while, and I have to go home with you...

124
08:36.465 --> 08:38.790
I'm just so thrilled I could die.

125
08:38.790 --> 08:42.418
Come out quickly before I get so excited that I lose my temper.

126
08:42.418 --> 08:44.128
Hello, sir.

127
08:44.128 --> 08:45.868
I heard the news.

128
08:45.868 --> 08:48.550
Thank you so much. Our Dul Hee...

129
08:48.550 --> 08:50.076
You're Seong Eun, right?

130
08:50.076 --> 08:51.905
Yes, I am.

131
08:51.905 --> 08:53.680
Nice to meet you.

132
08:53.680 --> 08:55.701
I have a favor to ask.

133
08:55.701 --> 08:56.794
Yes?

134
08:57.600 --> 09:01.534
Empty her bank account completely.

135
09:01.534 --> 09:05.817
Please find her a studio apartment far away from this neighborhood.

136
09:05.817 --> 09:07.367
As soon as possible.

137
09:07.367 --> 09:08.568
Okay?

138
09:09.780 --> 09:11.244
Okay.

139
09:11.244 --> 09:13.198
Okay.

140
09:13.198 --> 09:14.990
- Her bank account... - Right.

141
09:21.166 --> 09:23.543
Come out already! Hurry up!

142
09:23.543 --> 09:26.308
Time is money for me, even if it's not for you.

143
09:26.308 --> 09:28.427
Come out already!

144
09:29.338 --> 09:31.405
What's wrong with her?

145
09:35.722 --> 09:37.099
Give it to me. Give it.

146
09:37.099 --> 09:38.814
Give it.

147
09:40.585 --> 09:41.977
Let's go.

148
09:43.230 --> 09:45.216
- This is really heavy. - Yes, it is.

149
09:47.109 --> 09:48.826
Hey, hey. Big news.

150
09:48.826 --> 09:50.918
What? What is it?

151
09:51.696 --> 09:54.700
Kim Jin Mi's suspension is confirmed.

152
09:54.700 --> 09:58.370
Crazy. A suspension? I haven't heard that word in ages.

153
09:58.370 --> 10:03.880
Well, she really went too far. Kim Jin Mi gave me the creeps.

154
10:04.751 --> 10:08.540
But why isn't Sung Sae Ryeong here again?

155
10:08.540 --> 10:10.256
You still don't know?

156
10:10.256 --> 10:13.042
- Hey. They say she slit it. - Slit what?

157
10:13.042 --> 10:15.229
Her wrist. At the pool.

158
10:15.229 --> 10:16.512
- Her wrist? - Yes.

159
10:16.512 --> 10:17.792
- You don't know? - Her wrist?

160
10:17.792 --> 10:19.486
- At the pool. - Really?

161
10:26.732 --> 10:28.161
Hurry, hurry!

162
10:28.161 --> 10:29.507
The teacher...

163
10:30.456 --> 10:32.711
Please, just sit down. Sit.

164
10:33.449 --> 10:35.949
- Class President. - Here.

165
10:35.949 --> 10:38.993
It looks like it's just a cold.

166
10:38.993 --> 10:40.886
I'll go buy some medicine.

167
10:40.886 --> 10:43.975
I have to go to the factory anyway because of a machine issue.

168
10:43.975 --> 10:45.534
I'll buy it on my way back.

169
10:45.534 --> 10:46.681
Don't worry too much.

170
10:46.681 --> 10:49.212
What about the hospital? Shouldn't he go?

171
10:49.212 --> 10:51.076
Let's have him take medicine first.

172
10:51.076 --> 10:53.910
If the fever doesn't drop, we'll go.

173
10:54.537 --> 10:56.089
Don't worry too much.

174
10:56.720 --> 10:59.361
How can I not worry? His fever is 39 degrees.

175
11:00.397 --> 11:01.872
I'll be back.

176
11:36.068 --> 11:40.216
My baby. Don't ever do this again.

177
11:40.987 --> 11:45.518
Grandma will die without you.

178
11:45.518 --> 11:47.157
I know, Grandma.

179
11:47.157 --> 11:49.814
I won't do it again.

180
11:49.814 --> 11:52.191
You really mustn't. Promise?

181
11:52.191 --> 11:53.985
Yes. Don't worry.

182
11:53.985 --> 11:57.072
I really have no reason to die now.

183
11:57.072 --> 11:58.282
Really?

184
11:58.282 --> 11:59.778
Yes.

185
12:00.784 --> 12:03.504
Because Yu Gyeom...

186
12:07.791 --> 12:10.475
He can't abandon me anymore.

187
12:18.135 --> 12:19.494
I...

188
12:20.595 --> 12:24.672
I like it when you're in the water, going the farthest.

189
12:47.873 --> 12:49.275
Yu Gyeom.

190
13:47.683 --> 13:50.191
If I meet you again,

191
13:51.959 --> 13:54.604
it'll be the moment I watch you do it.

192
14:08.369 --> 14:09.495
[The 22nd National Swimming Championships]

193
14:09.495 --> 14:13.249
Sir, since we're in Seoul, should we go to an amusement park?

194
14:13.249 --> 14:15.293
I'm so pumped right now.

195
14:15.293 --> 14:19.602
Jeong Uk, how about using that time to shave off 0.01 seconds?

196
14:19.602 --> 14:23.025
Shave off 0.01 and the gap with Yu Gyeom will be 2.99 seconds, not 3.

197
14:23.025 --> 14:25.303
Sir, I told you I shaved off more than that.

198
14:25.303 --> 14:26.888
I shaved off 0.12 seconds.

199
14:26.888 --> 14:28.409
Alright, good job.

200
14:28.409 --> 14:29.665
Let's go eat.

201
14:29.665 --> 14:30.851
Go eat.

202
14:30.851 --> 14:33.060
Good grief!

203
14:33.060 --> 14:36.314
They keep calling. I said I'm not doing it.

204
14:36.314 --> 14:39.077
Yes, I'm not buying. I won't sign up.

205
14:39.077 --> 14:41.178
Sir, it's Yu Gyeom.

206
14:41.178 --> 14:42.961
What's going on with you?

207
14:45.990 --> 14:47.947
I want to enter the competition, sir.

208
14:47.947 --> 14:49.744
What?

209
14:49.744 --> 14:50.912
Hey!

210
14:50.912 --> 14:53.469
I want to enter the competition, sir.

211
14:57.753 --> 14:59.549
Sir. I...

212
15:00.796 --> 15:03.798
I won't stop after just one try like my father did.

213
15:04.865 --> 15:06.932
I'll do it once.

214
15:06.932 --> 15:08.522
I'll do it twice.

215
15:10.223 --> 15:12.308
I'm going to go all the way.

216
15:12.308 --> 15:16.592
Hey, hurry up and give me your ID number.

217
15:18.941 --> 15:21.299
I'll head over there now, sir.

218
15:22.985 --> 15:26.030
What? Registration will be closed by then. I'm in Seoul.

219
15:26.030 --> 15:29.492
- Where are you going? - You have email, right? Send it.

220
15:29.492 --> 15:30.952
No. What do you mean, school?

221
15:30.952 --> 15:32.996
Dad said you need a full day's rest.

222
15:32.996 --> 15:34.789
Your fever might come back.

223
15:34.789 --> 15:36.108
And you have to eat later.

224
15:36.108 --> 15:37.167
I'll be back.

225
15:37.167 --> 15:40.688
Hey! Yu Gyeom! Cho Yu Gyeom!

226
15:50.764 --> 15:52.080
I...

227
15:53.442 --> 15:56.013
I want to see you in the sea.

228
16:14.923 --> 16:16.691
Why didn't you come yesterday?

229
16:18.583 --> 16:20.219
What are you doing?

230
16:25.923 --> 16:27.633
Hey, lend me your phone.

231
16:27.633 --> 16:29.701
- Why? - Hurry.

232
16:29.701 --> 16:30.960
What are you doing?

233
16:36.852 --> 16:38.561
What are you doing?

234
16:38.561 --> 16:40.897
I don't want to carry your photo.

235
16:40.897 --> 16:44.875
I'm not giving my precious face to you either.

236
16:46.069 --> 16:47.363
Seriously.

237
16:50.911 --> 16:52.513
I just registered you.

238
16:52.513 --> 16:54.159
Really?

239
16:54.159 --> 16:55.288
Thank you, sir.

240
16:55.288 --> 16:57.580
Hey, by the way...

241
16:58.165 --> 17:01.459
You know you're applying independently, right?

242
17:01.459 --> 17:05.838
We planned to sponsor just one student, but I just squeezed you in.

243
17:05.838 --> 17:09.258
I can't exactly pull Jeong Uk out now.

244
17:09.258 --> 17:15.056
That swimming nut couldn't sleep last night fearing you would suddenly enter.

245
17:15.056 --> 17:17.437
But the prelims are in three days. You know?

246
17:17.437 --> 17:18.717
Yes, I know.

247
17:18.717 --> 17:22.522
Without school support, you'll get a lousy lane. You know that too?

248
17:22.522 --> 17:24.372
Yes, I know.

249
17:25.377 --> 17:27.089
You're confident, aren't you?

250
17:29.111 --> 17:32.520
No, I'm not.

251
17:32.520 --> 17:33.908
What?

252
17:33.908 --> 17:35.236
But...

253
17:37.534 --> 17:39.240
I'll do my best.

254
17:40.791 --> 17:43.271
Okay. I'll see you down there.

255
17:47.004 --> 17:49.221
Compete in good faith.

256
17:49.221 --> 17:50.257
Yes, sir.

257
17:50.257 --> 17:53.177
- Good luck. - Good luck.

258
17:53.177 --> 17:55.326
Spoken like true men.

259
17:55.326 --> 17:56.674
Jeong Uk.

260
17:56.674 --> 17:58.754
- You're the coach? - Yes, I am.

261
17:58.754 --> 18:00.309
- Really? - He's the athlete I trained.

262
18:00.309 --> 18:01.849
- See you later. - Okay.

263
18:01.849 --> 18:04.063
- See you later. - Goodbye.

264
18:04.063 --> 18:08.385
Hey, so Cho Yu Gyeom is entering the competition.

265
18:10.654 --> 18:12.613
No, sir.

266
18:12.613 --> 18:14.950
What do you mean, no? You're entering too.

267
18:14.950 --> 18:18.120
If Yu Gyeom enters, I'll lose.

268
18:18.120 --> 18:19.329
Look at this guy.

269
18:19.329 --> 18:22.544
How do you know? With your confidence...

270
18:23.464 --> 18:24.760
No.

271
18:25.792 --> 18:28.548
My confidence just plummeted.

272
18:28.548 --> 18:30.224
It's a total crash.

273
18:31.258 --> 18:33.358
Should I buy you beef?

274
18:34.344 --> 18:35.707
Wait, no.

275
18:36.680 --> 18:38.458
My confidence just skyrocketed.

276
18:39.084 --> 18:40.590
You little...

277
18:41.995 --> 18:43.220
What's with you?

278
18:44.238 --> 18:45.502
What?

279
18:45.502 --> 18:47.199
What are you signing up for?

280
18:49.951 --> 18:51.028
The swimming competition.

281
18:51.028 --> 18:52.241
What?

282
18:53.428 --> 18:55.286
Is that something to shout about?

283
18:55.286 --> 18:57.159
Of course it is.

284
18:57.159 --> 18:58.278
Why?

285
18:58.869 --> 18:59.920
Why?

286
19:00.743 --> 19:02.580
I should be asking you that.

287
19:02.580 --> 19:04.208
Why on earth are you doing this?

288
19:06.041 --> 19:09.383
Because I want to.

289
19:09.383 --> 19:10.546
No.

290
19:10.546 --> 19:13.408
You have always wanted to, but you never did.

291
19:13.408 --> 19:16.156
What suddenly changed your mind?

292
19:18.322 --> 19:19.794
Cho Yu Gyeom.

293
19:28.042 --> 19:29.677
I'm out of the hospital.

294
19:30.860 --> 19:32.992
Won't you ask if I'm okay?

295
19:33.863 --> 19:34.904
Are you okay?

296
19:34.904 --> 19:36.040
Yes.

297
19:36.040 --> 19:39.596
I'm fine because you were there.

298
19:41.494 --> 19:42.965
What?

299
19:42.965 --> 19:44.501
Are you going to hit me?

300
19:48.585 --> 19:50.016
But Yu Gyeom...

301
19:50.949 --> 19:53.083
Listen.

302
19:53.083 --> 19:55.939
Don't ever let go of this again.

303
19:55.939 --> 19:57.150
Okay?

304
19:58.549 --> 19:59.888
Never again.

305
20:05.503 --> 20:06.531
I won't.

306
20:06.531 --> 20:07.946
I promise.

307
20:30.166 --> 20:34.205
- Right. You really should never get married. - Really.

308
20:35.691 --> 20:39.631
When I was young, my aunt, a college student, came to visit our house.

309
20:40.427 --> 20:43.116
Ha Yeon, are you done playing?

310
20:43.116 --> 20:45.490
Come here, come here.

311
20:46.350 --> 20:47.769
Do you only like your aunt?

312
20:47.769 --> 20:50.375
The clothes my aunt wore looked pretty.

313
21:03.450 --> 21:08.212
So when she wasn't around, I secretly wore them in front of the mirror...

314
21:09.333 --> 21:11.144
Wait for me.

315
21:28.769 --> 21:32.739
But they didn't suit me at all.

316
21:42.656 --> 21:44.713
My aunt looked so pretty in them.

317
21:45.646 --> 21:48.747
Nevertheless, I had one wish.

318
21:48.747 --> 21:49.774
What?

319
21:49.774 --> 21:52.534
I wanted them to suit me well.

320
21:52.534 --> 21:54.044
- Why are you crying? - Kim Ha Yeon.

321
21:54.044 --> 21:56.560
- For them to fit me perfectly. - Isn't this your aunt's outfit?

322
22:04.554 --> 22:06.921
I wanted them to like me.

323
22:07.891 --> 22:09.999
I wanted them to like me as much as I liked them.

324
22:13.730 --> 22:17.067
An eighteen-year-old's sadness isn't necessarily mature.

325
22:19.109 --> 22:21.446
I still cry.

326
22:21.446 --> 22:26.111
For the same reason I did when I was seven.

327
22:33.832 --> 22:36.395
I didn't know there was a place like this here.

328
22:36.395 --> 22:38.455
This is all there is around here.

329
22:39.254 --> 22:41.205
- This spot looks good. - Yes.

330
22:47.941 --> 22:51.526
But aren't you tired, Jung Yeon?

331
22:51.526 --> 22:53.076
What?

332
22:53.076 --> 22:54.730
- Me? - Yes.

333
22:54.730 --> 22:57.563
You look like you haven't slept at all.

334
22:58.650 --> 23:01.901
No, I did sleep.

335
23:05.254 --> 23:09.094
Actually, I have something I'm really curious about.

336
23:10.115 --> 23:11.605
Then go ahead and ask.

337
23:12.579 --> 23:15.560
Why did you decide to date me?

338
23:15.560 --> 23:17.325
Do you like me?

339
23:19.011 --> 23:20.409
No.

340
23:20.409 --> 23:21.835
Not yet.

341
23:24.426 --> 23:26.094
I knew it.

342
23:26.876 --> 23:29.264
Then why did you decide to date me?

343
23:29.264 --> 23:32.472
Is it to learn sign language to your heart's content?

344
23:34.143 --> 23:35.972
Am I that kind of person?

345
23:35.972 --> 23:38.462
No, I'm that kind of person.

346
23:41.084 --> 23:46.506
I have just stopped rejecting people who confess to me.

347
23:51.869 --> 23:53.745
Not the answer you expected, right?

348
23:53.745 --> 23:55.956
I'm really glad I confessed then.

349
23:55.956 --> 23:57.124
Pardon?

350
23:57.124 --> 24:00.419
Then what about that Hye Min person?

351
24:00.419 --> 24:02.523
Didn't you reject her too?

352
24:02.523 --> 24:04.772
I did reject her.

353
24:04.772 --> 24:07.081
Then that's a bit inconsistent, isn't it?

354
24:07.081 --> 24:09.276
It only started from a certain point.

355
24:13.141 --> 24:16.615
You certainly have a lot of questions.

356
24:16.615 --> 24:19.300
Yes, I hear that a lot.

357
24:19.300 --> 24:22.278
My mom even tells me I'm too noisy.

358
24:22.278 --> 24:24.507
But my grandpa likes it when I chatter.

359
24:24.507 --> 24:26.955
He said I'm like a chirping lark.

360
24:30.553 --> 24:36.825
But why did you stop rejecting people who confess to you?

361
24:37.424 --> 24:38.789
I just...

362
24:39.374 --> 24:41.843
I can't do that anymore.

363
24:41.843 --> 24:46.297
I'm asking why you can't do that anymore.

364
24:48.467 --> 24:49.873
Is that a lunch box?

365
24:49.873 --> 24:51.451
Yes.

366
24:51.451 --> 24:53.250
I made it myself.

367
24:53.250 --> 24:55.260
It looks delicious.

368
24:55.260 --> 24:56.604
Wait a second.

369
25:04.793 --> 25:07.451
But I really hope for one thing.

370
25:07.451 --> 25:09.488
It shouldn't be out of guilt.

371
25:09.488 --> 25:11.244
You know, that kind of thing.

372
25:11.244 --> 25:15.597
Accepting me because you're afraid I'll suffer if you reject me?

373
25:19.480 --> 25:20.800
That's...

374
25:22.336 --> 25:24.379
I don't think it's guilt.

375
25:24.379 --> 25:26.131
Really?

376
25:26.131 --> 25:28.719
Then is it a sense of responsibility?

377
25:29.883 --> 25:30.897
It's delicious.

378
25:30.897 --> 25:32.456
Really?

379
25:32.456 --> 25:33.986
I'm so glad.

380
25:37.915 --> 25:41.799
You know, Jung Yeon, I want you to like me.

381
25:43.771 --> 25:46.080
Please like me, Jung Yeon.

382
25:47.560 --> 25:49.260
Please like me.

383
25:53.241 --> 25:54.996
I'll work hard for it.

384
26:00.289 --> 26:06.272
I know it's not something I can just ask for, but I'll work hard for it.

385
26:11.784 --> 26:12.981
Why?

386
26:16.765 --> 26:18.013
No.

387
26:18.694 --> 26:19.999
It's nothing.

388
26:23.186 --> 26:25.367
- Hey, what should we eat? - Burgers.

389
26:25.367 --> 26:26.924
- No. I don't like it. - How about hamburgers?

390
26:26.924 --> 26:28.819
- Good. - Why won't you eat burgers?

391
26:28.819 --> 26:30.445
- No reason. - Are you getting a burger?

392
26:30.445 --> 26:31.946
I'm not getting a burger.

393
26:34.366 --> 26:35.534
Pizza. How about pizza?

394
26:35.534 --> 26:37.697
- No. - Pizza?

395
26:39.162 --> 26:40.486
Why? Aren't you going?

396
26:41.562 --> 26:42.944
Go ahead.

397
26:42.944 --> 26:44.166
Why?

398
26:44.166 --> 26:45.733
I'm going to practice first.

399
26:45.733 --> 26:46.931
Practice?

400
26:46.931 --> 26:48.245
For what?

401
26:48.245 --> 26:49.451
He's entering the swim meet.

402
26:49.451 --> 26:51.716
- What? - Why?

403
26:51.716 --> 26:53.300
Go on. I'll go after practice.

404
26:53.300 --> 26:54.825
What's this about?

405
26:54.825 --> 26:58.076
You're really entering the meet?

406
26:58.076 --> 26:59.139
Hey!

407
26:59.139 --> 27:01.246
Yes, he is.

408
27:01.246 --> 27:02.451
Holy moly.

409
27:02.451 --> 27:04.482
Guacamole. Let's go.

410
27:17.264 --> 27:18.313
Hey.

411
27:19.536 --> 27:20.622
Well...

412
27:21.496 --> 27:23.801
Sorry for joining the meet so suddenly.

413
27:24.458 --> 27:25.928
It's okay.

414
27:25.928 --> 27:27.961
It's actually a relief.

415
27:27.961 --> 27:29.196
Why?

416
27:30.158 --> 27:35.050
I had a dream that you suddenly entered the competition.

417
27:35.050 --> 27:37.012
I heard about that.

418
27:37.012 --> 27:40.722
But come to think of it, that dream came true, right?

419
27:40.722 --> 27:43.057
Yes. But why is it a relief?

420
27:44.271 --> 27:46.018
Because in my dream...

421
27:47.731 --> 27:48.990
In the end...

422
27:53.412 --> 27:54.977
I beat you.

423
27:57.150 --> 27:59.949
Let's do our best, Cho Yu Gyeom.

424
28:04.990 --> 28:06.527
Kim Ha Yeon, you.

425
28:10.097 --> 28:11.399
What?

426
28:13.592 --> 28:17.488
Can't you please talk to me?

427
28:20.517 --> 28:22.269
Talk now.

428
28:22.269 --> 28:24.473
You're not this kind of person.

429
28:24.473 --> 28:26.768
Someone so out of control.

430
28:26.768 --> 28:29.606
Someone who's such a mess.

431
28:29.606 --> 28:31.701
That's not you.

432
28:31.701 --> 28:32.944
Is it?

433
28:37.041 --> 28:38.974
Then tell me.

434
28:40.901 --> 28:43.055
Were you perfect, Mom?

435
28:44.110 --> 28:45.225
What?

436
28:45.225 --> 28:46.826
I mean you, Mom.

437
28:47.718 --> 28:50.492
Were you perfect when you were my age?

438
28:50.492 --> 28:52.195
Were you okay?

439
28:54.713 --> 28:58.555
I was fine.

440
28:58.555 --> 29:01.687
I listened to your grandmother.

441
29:01.687 --> 29:03.126
And on the inside?

442
29:03.847 --> 29:05.569
What?

443
29:05.569 --> 29:06.600
On the inside?

444
29:06.600 --> 29:08.826
Was your heart okay?

445
29:08.826 --> 29:10.878
Without any waves?

446
29:11.813 --> 29:15.474
Are you talking about teenage angst right now?

447
29:16.067 --> 29:17.323
No.

448
29:18.605 --> 29:21.430
I'm just talking about being my age.

449
29:21.430 --> 29:25.909
The age when earthquakes, typhoons, fires, and whirlwinds rage in your heart.

450
29:27.317 --> 29:32.872
I don't think you were perfect at my age just because you're my mom.

451
29:33.575 --> 29:35.808
How can anyone live like that?

452
29:36.534 --> 29:42.512
Some days are fine, some days are a mess, and then some days are fine again.

453
29:42.512 --> 29:44.282
That's how life is.

454
29:51.229 --> 29:54.227
Mom, give me something to eat.

455
29:56.652 --> 29:58.642
Can you say that again?

456
29:59.245 --> 30:02.777
I don't understand.

457
30:06.363 --> 30:10.779
I'm saying I'm like this because being my age is a mess.

458
30:11.877 --> 30:14.700
Not because I'm a mess.

459
30:17.134 --> 30:18.517
Mom.

460
30:21.454 --> 30:23.517
You know...

461
30:24.104 --> 30:28.535
I'm sure you were just like me when you were my age.

462
30:28.535 --> 30:30.696
I'm leaving now.

463
30:45.437 --> 30:46.719
Mom.

464
30:47.703 --> 30:49.396
Some food...

465
30:50.462 --> 30:52.524
Can you get it yourself?

466
30:54.991 --> 30:56.284
Right.

467
30:56.284 --> 30:58.488
We'll leave in the afternoon.

468
30:59.254 --> 31:01.214
Did you all pack your bags?

469
31:01.214 --> 31:02.473
Yes, sir.

470
31:02.473 --> 31:04.062
Jeong Uk is in lane 3.

471
31:04.062 --> 31:05.589
Yu Gyeom is...

472
31:06.636 --> 31:08.095
You are in lane 8.

473
31:08.095 --> 31:10.955
Cho Yu Gyeom, you brought this on yourself.

474
31:10.955 --> 31:12.078
Yes, sir.

475
31:12.078 --> 31:13.101
Good.

476
31:13.101 --> 31:14.826
Then come here after lunch.

477
31:14.826 --> 31:15.981
Let's head out together.

478
31:15.981 --> 31:17.117
Yes, sir.

479
31:17.117 --> 31:18.800
Hey, see you later.

480
31:21.839 --> 31:23.747
Right. Cho Yu Gyeom.

481
31:25.629 --> 31:27.692
You're not...

482
31:28.284 --> 31:29.569
You know...

483
31:30.579 --> 31:33.590
You're not going to the competition without telling your family, are you?

484
31:34.563 --> 31:35.582
I haven't told them.

485
31:35.582 --> 31:38.084
What? Why?

486
31:38.084 --> 31:39.774
I just wasn't going to tell them.

487
31:39.774 --> 31:43.805
What? No. If you don't tell them, I'll have to.

488
31:44.438 --> 31:45.868
Call them now.

489
31:45.868 --> 31:47.035
Hurry.

490
31:47.035 --> 31:48.196
Go on.

491
31:49.014 --> 31:51.316
Just tell them, man. Do it.

492
32:12.704 --> 32:15.232
I need to check that.

493
32:15.232 --> 32:16.822
Sam Hee.

494
32:17.544 --> 32:19.111
Where did she go?

495
32:20.423 --> 32:21.613
Yes. Hello?

496
32:21.613 --> 32:22.671
Mom.

497
32:22.671 --> 32:24.089
Yu Gyeom.

498
32:24.089 --> 32:26.824
Is something wrong? I'm busy right now.

499
32:26.824 --> 32:28.809
I'm going to a swim meet.

500
32:29.427 --> 32:30.603
What?

501
32:30.603 --> 32:32.478
I'm going to a swim meet.

502
32:34.975 --> 32:37.079
Are you just notifying me?

503
32:37.079 --> 32:38.463
Yes, I am.

504
32:38.463 --> 32:39.700
I'm sorry.

505
32:42.776 --> 32:44.096
Hello?

506
32:45.628 --> 32:46.807
Mom?

507
32:48.446 --> 32:50.156
When is it?

508
32:50.156 --> 32:51.702
Tomorrow.

509
32:51.702 --> 32:53.618
Tomorrow?

510
32:53.618 --> 32:58.081
Right. If it's tomorrow, first we have the ancestral rite today.

511
32:58.081 --> 33:01.114
I'll sleep in Seoul today and come back after the meet.

512
33:01.114 --> 33:02.337
No, Cho Yu Gyeom.

513
33:02.337 --> 33:03.974
Absolutely not.

514
33:03.974 --> 33:06.218
You have an ancestral rite today.

515
33:07.799 --> 33:10.459
What are you going to tell your grandfather?

516
33:10.459 --> 33:11.940
It doesn't matter what you say.

517
33:11.940 --> 33:16.349
You can't go to the meet, and you definitely can't miss the rite.

518
33:16.349 --> 33:19.047
What kind of heir would miss an ancestral rite?

519
33:19.047 --> 33:22.323
Ma'am, you shouldn't take that over there.

520
33:23.064 --> 33:25.845
Yu Gyeom, Mom will...

521
33:25.845 --> 33:27.901
I don't want to live like Dad.

522
33:31.740 --> 33:33.952
Please contact me anytime.

523
33:33.952 --> 33:35.578
I'm honored.

524
33:41.893 --> 33:44.338
- Hello. - Hello.

525
33:44.338 --> 33:46.407
I don't want to live like Dad.

526
33:47.110 --> 33:49.635
But at this rate, Mom...

527
33:49.635 --> 33:51.858
I'll definitely end up like him.

528
33:52.921 --> 33:54.792
Mom, seriously...

529
33:59.001 --> 34:00.617
Isn't that just too terrible?

530
34:06.048 --> 34:09.486
Ma'am, where should I put the japchae?

531
34:09.486 --> 34:11.863
Ma'am, is this enough fish?

532
34:11.863 --> 34:13.907
Ma'am, the elder is looking for you.

533
34:13.907 --> 34:16.383
Ma'am, should I brown the bulgogi more?

534
34:16.383 --> 34:19.245
Ma'am, should I fry more meat patties?

535
34:19.245 --> 34:20.673
Ma'am.

536
34:33.113 --> 34:34.384
Yes.

537
34:35.671 --> 34:37.148
It is terrible.

538
34:42.264 --> 34:43.510
Go.

539
34:45.151 --> 34:46.981
Thanks, Mom. About Grandpa...

540
34:46.981 --> 34:49.027
I'll take care of that.

541
34:49.027 --> 34:50.574
Okay.

542
34:52.201 --> 34:53.750
Alright.

543
34:53.750 --> 34:56.084
Good luck, son.

544
34:56.084 --> 34:57.301
Yes.

545
34:57.301 --> 34:58.567
Son.

546
35:02.666 --> 35:05.109
Say hello. I'm your father.

547
35:06.918 --> 35:10.218
- Hello. Father. - Right. My son.

548
35:10.218 --> 35:13.671
It's good to see you at school.

549
35:14.353 --> 35:16.268
I can't make the ancestral rite today.

550
35:16.268 --> 35:17.511
What?

551
35:18.276 --> 35:21.626
Father, please explain it well to Grandpa for me.

552
35:24.771 --> 35:26.743
Why can't you come to the rite?

553
35:26.743 --> 35:28.283
No.

554
35:29.192 --> 35:31.901
Isn't it better for you to tell him rather than Mom?

555
35:31.901 --> 35:33.571
You can take a hit better.

556
35:33.571 --> 35:35.387
What are you talking about?

557
35:35.387 --> 35:38.692
No. You have to attend the rite. You absolutely must!

558
35:39.953 --> 35:42.102
I'm entering a swim meet.

559
35:45.667 --> 35:47.407
I'm leaving now, Father.

560
35:55.135 --> 35:56.333
Honestly!

561
36:00.013 --> 36:01.764
No, wait...

562
36:01.764 --> 36:05.020
Yu Gyeom is very clear about his opinions.

563
36:05.020 --> 36:06.659
I'll go give him a talking-to.

564
36:06.659 --> 36:09.026
Yu Gyeom! Cho Yu Gyeom!

565
36:15.987 --> 36:17.489
Hey, hey!

566
36:17.489 --> 36:20.074
Is Cho Yu Gyeom really entering? No way, right?

567
36:20.074 --> 36:22.243
No, it's true.

568
36:22.243 --> 36:24.564
I heard he's going to Seoul today.

569
36:24.564 --> 36:27.656
Holy moly guacamole roly-poly.

570
36:28.958 --> 36:31.581
That's such an outdated expression.

571
36:31.581 --> 36:33.796
Sae Ryeong, did you talk him into it?

572
36:33.796 --> 36:36.090
Into entering the competition?

573
36:36.090 --> 36:37.122
What?

574
36:37.122 --> 36:41.364
I mean, Cho Yu Gyeom never entered competitions no matter how good he was.

575
36:41.364 --> 36:42.818
But now he is.

576
36:42.818 --> 36:45.401
That means you convinced him, right?

577
36:49.604 --> 36:53.860
Sae Ryeong, then you're going to Seoul tomorrow too. Right?

578
36:53.860 --> 36:55.398
Why would I go to Seoul?

579
36:55.398 --> 36:56.451
Why else?

580
36:56.451 --> 36:58.136
To cheer for Yu Gyeom.

581
37:01.074 --> 37:02.242
What?

582
37:02.242 --> 37:03.745
You weren't planning to go?

583
37:03.745 --> 37:07.418
He's doing this because of you. How can you not go?

584
37:10.797 --> 37:11.909
Right.

585
37:11.909 --> 37:13.242
I'm his girlfriend.

586
37:13.242 --> 37:14.968
I definitely have to go.

587
37:14.968 --> 37:18.246
Yu Gyeom is entering the competition for me, right?

588
37:18.246 --> 37:19.968
- Want to come too? - Really?

589
37:19.968 --> 37:21.523
I'm in! I would love to.

590
37:21.523 --> 37:22.929
Awesome.

591
37:22.929 --> 37:24.389
I'll ask Yu Gyeom.

592
37:24.389 --> 37:27.452
Hey, Sung Sae Ryeong. Ask for us too, so we can all go.

593
37:27.452 --> 37:29.005
Lee Won Bae. You're going, right?

594
37:29.005 --> 37:31.318
Why would I...

595
37:31.318 --> 37:34.243
Let's go see Seoul for a change.

596
37:34.243 --> 37:35.319
It'll be a nice change.

597
37:35.319 --> 37:38.742
What change of pace?

598
37:38.742 --> 37:40.148
Lee Won Bae.

599
37:41.316 --> 37:42.778
What?

600
37:46.354 --> 37:47.914
Come out here for a second.

601
37:49.043 --> 37:50.206
Yu Gyeom, you're here?

602
37:50.206 --> 37:52.095
Yes, Lord Yu Gyeom.

603
37:52.095 --> 37:54.163
I'm coming.

604
37:58.592 --> 38:00.501
Then for me, the sea...

605
38:02.919 --> 38:07.205
I want to swim with all my strength as far as I can go.

606
38:08.396 --> 38:10.022
That's my dream.

607
39:59.259 --> 40:01.567
This is your first warning.

608
40:04.287 --> 40:05.662
Why?

609
40:06.877 --> 40:11.265
Next time, I won't care if you're hurt or not. Get out.

610
40:13.852 --> 40:16.769
Do you happen to have a girlfriend?

611
40:16.769 --> 40:19.230
Slow down a bit.

612
40:19.230 --> 40:23.822
I asked if you have a girlfriend.

613
40:25.614 --> 40:27.102
I do.

614
40:30.622 --> 40:31.909
Hey.

615
40:31.909 --> 40:35.389
Because I'm 30 now.

616
40:35.389 --> 40:37.016
So I see her sometimes.

617
40:39.336 --> 40:41.627
The girl you're dating?

618
40:41.627 --> 40:43.120
Who would date me?

619
40:43.120 --> 40:45.619
I leave dates whenever I get a call.

620
40:45.619 --> 40:50.658
We just meet up sometimes.

621
40:53.347 --> 40:55.102
Then that's fine.

622
40:55.102 --> 40:56.402
Fine?

623
41:00.031 --> 41:02.236
Fine? What's fine?

624
41:05.862 --> 41:07.832
What do you mean by that?

625
41:07.832 --> 41:09.100
Hey!

626
41:10.591 --> 41:12.624
She can't hear me.

627
41:20.666 --> 41:21.837
[A Family of Scholars]

628
41:24.047 --> 41:25.303
Honey.

629
41:29.996 --> 41:32.099
You'll talk about Yu Gyeom, right?

630
41:34.332 --> 41:37.102
Father. It's Jae Jin.

631
41:37.102 --> 41:39.017
Come in.

632
41:41.440 --> 41:43.518
I'll do it. Let me.

633
41:44.271 --> 41:45.968
I'm good at taking hits.

634
41:53.677 --> 41:55.347
What?

635
41:56.909 --> 41:58.111
Well...

636
41:58.923 --> 42:00.528
You see...

637
42:00.528 --> 42:02.026
Yu Gyeom...

638
42:02.792 --> 42:06.097
He won't be able to attend the ancestral rite.

639
42:06.097 --> 42:07.789
Yu Gyeom's father.

640
42:07.789 --> 42:10.269
Does that make any sense?

641
42:10.269 --> 42:12.809
I know it doesn't.

642
42:13.663 --> 42:14.976
But Father.

643
42:14.976 --> 42:17.849
Yu Gyeom is competing in a major meet--

644
42:17.849 --> 42:20.466
Stop talking nonsense and bring him here!

645
42:39.581 --> 42:41.204
Come out here for a second.

646
42:43.416 --> 42:45.879
Is Cho Yu Gyeom really entering? No way, right?

647
42:45.879 --> 42:48.418
No, it's true.

648
43:00.644 --> 43:01.951
Mom.

649
43:01.951 --> 43:03.603
You have Sung Sae Ryeong's number.

650
43:03.603 --> 43:05.451
Jeez! You scared me!

651
43:05.451 --> 43:09.224
You must have her number. I heard you two even swapped credit cards.

652
43:10.318 --> 43:11.943
No, well...

653
43:13.076 --> 43:14.534
I do have it.

654
43:14.534 --> 43:16.782
Then give it to me.

655
43:16.782 --> 43:19.559
Hey, don't you have her number?

656
43:19.559 --> 43:21.871
No, I don't.

657
43:21.871 --> 43:23.497
Why not?

658
43:23.497 --> 43:24.576
Mom.

659
43:24.576 --> 43:28.160
Would you want to swap numbers with a girl who gave you a concussion?

660
43:28.160 --> 43:31.601
She also stole your boyfriend.

661
43:34.011 --> 43:35.971
Hurry.

662
43:35.971 --> 43:37.516
Fine.

663
43:39.055 --> 43:41.240
- 010. - Okay.

664
43:41.240 --> 43:43.447
0218.

665
43:43.447 --> 43:44.834
Hey.

666
43:44.834 --> 43:47.274
You won't cause trouble again, right?

667
43:47.274 --> 43:49.670
It's not like that. Hurry up.

668
43:57.993 --> 43:59.310
Hello?

669
44:00.267 --> 44:01.697
It's Sae Ryeong.

670
44:01.697 --> 44:02.951
No way.

671
44:02.951 --> 44:04.291
Sung Sae Ryeong.

672
44:04.291 --> 44:07.541
Why are you calling me? What's the occasion?

673
44:07.541 --> 44:09.429
You're with Yu Gyeom, aren't you?

674
44:09.429 --> 44:10.544
What?

675
44:10.544 --> 44:12.115
What was that?

676
44:12.115 --> 44:13.409
Put Yu Gyeom on.

677
44:13.409 --> 44:15.117
He doesn't have his phone.

678
44:16.672 --> 44:17.784
I don't want to.

679
44:17.784 --> 44:18.899
Why?

680
44:18.899 --> 44:20.429
I just don't.

681
44:20.429 --> 44:22.578
Call him yourself.

682
44:22.578 --> 44:24.117
We're at the Fricks Hotel.

683
44:24.117 --> 44:26.978
He's in room 2001. Happy?

684
44:26.978 --> 44:29.275
- I'm hanging up. - Im Jeong Uk.

685
44:29.275 --> 44:31.812
I know you like me.

686
44:33.614 --> 44:36.369
I heard your dad owns a golf course.

687
44:36.369 --> 44:38.491
He has several, right?

688
44:42.310 --> 44:45.584
Life is long, you know?

689
44:46.414 --> 44:50.672
[Fricks Hotel] I'm saying we don't know what the future holds.

690
44:50.672 --> 44:53.949
But right now, I'm with Cho Yu Gyeom.

691
44:53.949 --> 44:55.634
Do you understand?

692
44:55.634 --> 44:57.421
You won't always be...

693
44:58.759 --> 45:01.012
This crazy girl.

694
45:01.012 --> 45:04.459
Did you just swear at me?

695
45:04.459 --> 45:07.278
Why would I swear at you? Seriously! I'm hanging up.

696
45:07.945 --> 45:09.398
I'm Kim Ha Yeon.

697
45:09.398 --> 45:12.693
Sung Sae Ryeong, want to meet?

698
45:12.693 --> 45:14.098
Right now.

699
45:39.398 --> 45:41.876
When are you bringing Yu Gyeom home?

700
45:48.977 --> 45:50.215
Seriously!

701
45:55.589 --> 45:57.931
[Men's High School 200m Freestyle Qualifying Round 12]

702
46:08.795 --> 46:11.998
Why are you guys so nervous?

703
46:11.998 --> 46:14.460
You don't have to win first place. Don't.

704
46:14.460 --> 46:16.420
Really, sir? We really don't have to?

705
46:16.420 --> 46:20.651
Yes, you don't. How can both of you win? Only one of you needs to take first.

706
46:20.651 --> 46:24.428
If the vice principal doesn't chew me out, we're having a beef party.

707
46:24.428 --> 46:25.763
That's what's important.

708
46:25.763 --> 46:28.034
Did you just laugh?

709
46:28.034 --> 46:29.367
Don't be nervous.

710
46:29.367 --> 46:32.686
But have the mindset that you'll win even if it kills you.

711
46:32.686 --> 46:34.441
- Okay? Okay? - Yes.

712
46:34.441 --> 46:35.874
Hands in.

713
46:36.939 --> 46:38.522
One, two, three. Upo!

714
46:38.522 --> 46:40.339
- Okay! - Okay.

715
46:41.070 --> 46:44.532
- We're starting. Athletes, please gather. - Yes.

716
46:44.532 --> 46:45.658
Okay.

717
46:45.658 --> 46:47.186
- Lane 1, Lee Su Chang. - Yes.

718
46:47.186 --> 46:48.497
- Lane 2, Ma Gyeong Beom. - Yes.

719
46:48.497 --> 46:49.810
- Lane 3, Im Jeong Uk. - Yes.

720
46:49.810 --> 46:51.271
- Lane 4, Kim Tae Woon. - Yes.

721
46:51.271 --> 46:52.461
- Lane 5, Kim Chan Hyeok. - Yes.

722
46:52.461 --> 46:53.874
- Lane 6, Min Seung Gyu. - Yes.

723
46:53.874 --> 46:54.974
- Lane 7, Lee Gyu Seong. - Yes.

724
46:54.974 --> 46:56.460
- Lane 8, Cho Yu Gyeom. - Yes.

725
46:56.460 --> 46:59.598
Okay. Let's enter in order, starting with lane one.

726
47:03.900 --> 47:08.104
Next, we'll broadcast the 22nd National Swimming Championships.

727
47:08.104 --> 47:14.523
This is the Men's High School 200m Freestyle Qualifying Round 12.

728
47:14.523 --> 47:17.216
- The athletes are now entering. - Yes.

729
47:18.566 --> 47:21.545
In lane 5, Kim Chan Hyeok, a senior at Ulsan Sports High School.

730
47:21.545 --> 47:24.333
In lane 6, Min Seung Gyu, a freshman at Seoul Sports High School.

731
47:24.333 --> 47:27.072
Lane 7, Lee Gyu Seong, a sophomore at Gyeonggi Jeil High School.

732
47:27.072 --> 47:29.827
Lane 8, Cho Yu Gyeom, a sophomore at Andong Upo High School.

733
47:29.827 --> 47:32.663
These eight athletes will compete in the preliminaries.

734
47:32.663 --> 47:37.334
The athletes must show off the skills they have honed for this day.

735
47:37.334 --> 47:43.183
I'm looking forward to seeing many new records set today.

736
47:55.019 --> 47:59.183
Yes, they must have sweated buckets to prepare for this stage.

737
47:59.183 --> 48:02.850
They must be feeling very nervous at this moment before the start.

738
48:02.850 --> 48:06.113
- That's right. Who gets the best start... - Yes.

739
48:06.113 --> 48:10.831
And since it's a 200m race, they have to do four laps in a 50m pool.

740
48:10.831 --> 48:15.664
So it's crucial when they decide to make their final spurt.

741
48:15.664 --> 48:17.541
The athletes are on the starting blocks.

742
48:17.541 --> 48:23.258
This is the Men's High School 200m Freestyle Qualifying Round 12.

743
48:30.706 --> 48:33.849
Im Jeong Uk is currently taking the lead.

744
48:33.849 --> 48:37.102
As expected, Im Jeong Uk of Upo High School stands out.

745
48:37.102 --> 48:41.273
Right. He showed a very strong spurt in his previous performance as well.

746
48:41.273 --> 48:44.109
Good. Go, go!

747
48:44.109 --> 48:48.864
Isn't Cho Jae Jin, the first Asian to reach an Olympic final, from this school?

748
48:48.864 --> 48:52.868
That's right. But there's another athlete from Upo High School competing.

749
48:52.868 --> 48:57.598
I heard Cho Yu Gyeom in lane eight is Cho Jae Jin's son.

750
48:57.598 --> 49:02.044
But he's not as fast as I expected.

751
49:02.044 --> 49:04.546
Of course, we'll have to see how the race ends.

752
49:04.546 --> 49:09.973
For now, Im Jeong Uk in lane three is maintaining the lead.

753
49:11.753 --> 49:14.556
We were eighteen back then.

754
49:14.556 --> 49:19.416
Cho Yu Gyeom in lane eight is now making the 100m turn.

755
49:20.271 --> 49:21.855
He's speeding up but needs more.

756
49:21.855 --> 49:25.369
He needs to push harder to reach the lead group.

757
49:27.197 --> 49:31.616
Why is the boy I told you to bring appearing on television?

758
49:36.130 --> 49:39.561
At that age, I couldn't do much, even when angry at the world.

759
49:51.096 --> 49:54.993
An age where love only led to goodbyes.

760
49:54.993 --> 49:56.361
Eighteen.

761
50:08.700 --> 50:09.730
Stay calm.

762
50:09.730 --> 50:15.356
He's slowly moving up after the turn and is now in fourth place.

763
50:15.356 --> 50:19.608
After the 100m turn, there are only three athletes ahead of him.

764
50:19.608 --> 50:23.384
He's just made the 150m turn.

765
50:23.384 --> 50:27.037
Cho Yu Gyeom in lane eight. He's starting to pull ahead!

766
50:27.037 --> 50:32.302
Cho Yu Gyeom is incredible. He's starting his final spurt.

767
50:32.302 --> 50:36.096
Only Im Jeong Uk in lane three is left in front of him now.

768
50:53.090 --> 50:56.955
Nevertheless, I wanted to try.

769
51:35.364 --> 51:39.034
[Cho Yu Gyeom, Upo High School, 1st Place]

770
51:39.034 --> 51:44.030
Cho Yu Gyeom in lane eight finishes with a time of 1:48.08.

771
51:44.030 --> 51:49.420
That's amazing! This is the fastest time we have seen in these preliminaries!

772
51:49.420 --> 51:53.343
It's even faster than the record of the current ace, Baek Seung Woo.

773
51:53.343 --> 51:56.343
- Cho Yu Gyeom has taken first place. - Yes.

774
51:56.343 --> 51:58.525
Where has this athlete been all this time?

775
51:58.525 --> 52:01.265
Incredible. First place, Cho Yu Gyeom, 1:48.08.

776
52:01.265 --> 52:04.726
- Second place, Im Jeong Uk, 1:49.38. - Yes.

777
52:04.726 --> 52:06.670
It was an incredibly close race.

778
52:06.670 --> 52:11.702
Cho Yu Gyeom makes a brilliant comeback from last to first place.

779
52:26.126 --> 52:27.940
Yes, Principal.

780
52:28.962 --> 52:30.464
What?

781
52:30.464 --> 52:35.011
I didn't submit it. Yu Gyeom applied on his own.

782
52:37.809 --> 52:41.855
I heard Yu Gyeom explained it well...

783
52:43.516 --> 52:49.128
Yes. Anyway, I'll see you when I get back. Yes.

784
52:53.516 --> 52:54.860
Sir! Hurry up!

785
52:54.860 --> 52:57.250
- Sir! Meat! Meat! - Meat! Meat!

786
52:57.250 --> 53:00.953
- Meat! - Beef!

787
53:00.953 --> 53:02.678
Fine, eat up.

788
53:03.778 --> 53:06.583
- Is it beef? - Beef?

789
53:06.583 --> 53:08.058
It's pork.

790
53:10.584 --> 53:13.038
- Pork it is! Pork! - Pork! Pork!

791
53:13.038 --> 53:15.342
Don't you guys eat greens?

792
53:15.342 --> 53:17.716
- No way. - No.

793
53:17.716 --> 53:19.843
- But why isn't Cho Yu Gyeom coming out? - Yu Gyeom?

794
53:19.843 --> 53:21.498
- Right? - Where did Yu Gyeom go?

795
53:21.498 --> 53:23.971
Sae Ryeong, why isn't Yu Gyeom out yet?

796
53:25.088 --> 53:26.353
Cho Yu Gyeom.

797
53:26.353 --> 53:28.565
- Cho Yu Gyeom! - Cho Yu Gyeom!

798
53:30.187 --> 53:31.439
Congrats on first place.

799
53:31.439 --> 53:34.465
- Cho Yu Gyeom! Cho Yu Gyeom! - My boyfriend rocks.

800
53:40.242 --> 53:41.319
What?

801
53:48.158 --> 53:50.453
Cho Yu Gyeom, what's going on?

802
53:50.453 --> 53:52.076
I think I have to go.

803
53:52.076 --> 53:53.396
Where?

804
53:54.221 --> 53:55.605
Where?

805
53:56.815 --> 53:58.480
Tell me where you're going.

806
53:59.857 --> 54:01.080
You know.

807
54:02.553 --> 54:04.617
- What? - Take this.

808
54:04.617 --> 54:06.295
- What? - Hey!

809
54:06.295 --> 54:07.659
Sir, where is he going?

810
54:07.659 --> 54:10.278
Who cares where he goes?

811
54:10.278 --> 54:13.399
I'm busy worrying about the principal chewing me out.

812
54:14.851 --> 54:16.078
Sae Ryeong.

813
54:16.078 --> 54:18.120
Where did he say he was going?

814
54:33.584 --> 54:35.961
There's less than two weeks left.

815
54:35.961 --> 54:37.640
What are you talking about?

816
54:37.640 --> 54:39.052
Summer vacation.

817
54:39.952 --> 54:41.313
What about it?

818
54:42.442 --> 54:45.313
You said you'd be with Yu Gyeom for the rest of your life.

819
54:45.313 --> 54:47.576
You're finally admitting it.

820
54:47.576 --> 54:48.743
Why?

821
54:48.743 --> 54:50.666
Did reality hit you that hard?

822
54:51.772 --> 54:55.694
Just two weeks out of your lifetime.

823
54:55.694 --> 54:58.448
I'm going to be with Yu Gyeom just for that long.

824
54:58.448 --> 54:59.486
What?

825
55:00.656 --> 55:03.418
I was just going to give up and leave.

826
55:04.680 --> 55:05.924
No.

827
55:06.893 --> 55:08.474
I can't.

828
55:08.474 --> 55:11.212
It feels unfair no matter how I look at it.

829
55:11.212 --> 55:14.514
Look, no matter what you say, Yu Gyeom already--

830
55:14.514 --> 55:15.735
No.

831
55:16.554 --> 55:18.180
You know it too.

832
55:19.515 --> 55:21.658
Cho Yu Gyeom still likes me.

833
55:21.658 --> 55:22.781
What?

834
55:23.972 --> 55:26.604
It's your loss if you end it like this.

835
55:26.604 --> 55:31.156
You have to date and break up properly to have no regrets, right?

836
55:31.747 --> 55:34.251
If you don't send Yu Gyeom to me now...

837
55:35.649 --> 55:39.028
He'll spend his whole life missing me by your side.

838
55:41.154 --> 55:42.935
Are you okay with that?

839
55:48.049 --> 55:49.188
Hey.

840
55:50.153 --> 55:51.986
Where do you get this confidence?

841
55:51.986 --> 55:53.376
Two weeks is all I need.

842
55:54.950 --> 55:56.315
Just two weeks.

843
55:57.773 --> 56:00.096
After that, he'll forget me.

844
56:01.326 --> 56:02.991
I'll forget him, too.

845
56:04.969 --> 56:07.871
And Yu Gyeom will stay by your side for the rest of his life.

846
56:09.850 --> 56:11.894
I came here to tell you this.

847
56:12.896 --> 56:16.395
If I just take him, you might hold onto him with self-harm.

848
56:16.395 --> 56:17.767
Kim Ha Yeon.

849
56:20.585 --> 56:22.007
I...

850
56:24.639 --> 56:27.160
I think you have changed a little.

851
56:28.281 --> 56:30.827
Just as I have changed over this summer.

852
56:30.827 --> 56:31.948
Hey.

853
57:17.376 --> 57:18.789
Ha Yeon.

854
57:25.926 --> 57:27.367
Yu Gyeom.

855
57:29.218 --> 57:30.565
Go ahead.

856
57:34.142 --> 57:37.068
I'm not going home tonight.

857
57:40.107 --> 57:41.209
Okay.

858
57:42.117 --> 57:43.502
Let's do that.

859
57:47.739 --> 57:53.263
Meeting you, holding your hand, touching you, and hugging you.

860
57:54.685 --> 57:59.279
I dared to hope we would collide as if everything would burn up.

861
58:01.109 --> 58:05.174
When I was eighteen, I could do nothing.
